Improved performance of `BaseModel.get_absolute_url()` by memoizing each model's route shape (resolved once with a sentinel pk, then reused as a string template) — previously every call performed up to three `reverse()` attempts, once per rendered object in REST API brief representations built from generic foreign keys or cable fields, and in UI table renderings. Also memoized the API list URL that dynamic form fields attach to their select widgets — previously every form clean (including filterset validation on REST API requests, where the widget is never rendered) performed a URL reversal per dynamic field.
